## 🐛 Bug Fixes & Reliability

- **Agent Tool Hardening**:
  - Added strict input validation and null guards across all built-in tools.
- **Security & SSRF Protection**:
  - Blocked link-local and cloud-metadata addresses in `WebFetch` to prevent SSRF vulnerabilities.
- **Memory & Visual Artifact Management**:
  - Fixed HTTP 413 payload errors during multi-turn vision tasks by replacing in-memory screenshot bitmaps with compact metadata placeholders between tool loops.
- **Windows Platform Stability**:
  - Handled Windows user-mapped memory sections with automatic write-lock retry logic.
  - Corrected Windows virtual key code mapping (`VK_WINDOWS`) and input chord handling in desktop automation.
- **macOS Metal Rendering Pipeline**:
  - Resolved display sleep/wake crash issues on macOS Metal displays (`CVDisplayLink`).
- **Jackson Polymorphic Serialization**:
  - Resolved type ID conflicts on Jupyter cell and output definitions in `base/smile.util.ipynb`.
- **Stream Output Synchronization**:
  - Fixed race condition where REPL output streaming could lag behind prompt notifications during rapid resets.
- **ONNX Model Crash Prevention**:
  - Prevented process termination on SIGINT/Ctrl+C during native ONNX and Torch model execution.

